(7495392, 1193900, 102278, '<td valign="top">A fabulous tangle. So much to explore in this photograph and it''s my favourite of the challenge. The muted contrast- partly dictated by the Minimal Editing - is just about perfect. I''d probably go and ruin the image by adding too much contrast and toying with it but it''s just right as it is. I even love that torn strip of white at the bottom of the frame. Glorious. 10.</td>', 'A fabulous tangle. So much to explore in this photograph and it''s my favourite of the challenge. The muted contrast- partly dictated by the Minimal Editing - is just about perfect. I''d probably go and ruin the image by adding too much contrast and toying with it but it''s just right as it is. I even love that torn strip of white at the bottom of the frame. Glorious. 10.', '2017-01-29 08:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7495393, 1193508, 102278, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, Lots of movement and character. Like an underwater opera. This is my second favourite in the challenge and my choice for the Red ribbon.9.</td>', 'Wonderful, Lots of movement and character. Like an underwater opera. This is my second favourite in the challenge and my choice for the Red ribbon.9.', '2017-01-29 08:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
